/dataset
/dataset-archive
# Crops. Most of it is derived -- `scripts/crops.py extract` rebuilds it from
# /dataset -- and the training cache alone runs to 143MB.
# NOTE: `crops/labelled/` is the one part nothing regenerates, because the
# folder names are hand-made. It is ignored here rather than carried as ~3,900
# small files; keep your own copy of it the way /dataset-archive is kept.
/crops
# Trained weights: regenerated by scripts/, and too big to carry. What a model
# is worth is recorded in docs/DATASET-FINDINGS.md, which is the part worth
# keeping.
/models/*.onnx
/models/*.pt
# ...and the sidecar that carries a model's class order and held-out sessions.
# Useless without the weights beside it, and actively misleading committed on
# its own: it names 26 classes for a file nobody has.
/models/character.json
